# SurfDoc native diagrams

One `.surf` source, deterministic server-side SVG for every diagram kind.

## Architecture

::diagram[type=architecture title="Request flow"]
web: Web Frontend
api: API Gateway
svc: Auth Service
db: Postgres
web -> api: HTTPS
api -> svc: gRPC
api -> db: SQL
svc -> db: SQL
::

## Entity-relationship

::diagram[type=erd title="Core schema"]
users: id pk, email unique, name
docs: id pk, owner_id fk, title
tags: id pk, label unique
users 1--* docs: owns
docs *--* tags: labeled
::

## Flowchart

::diagram[type=flowchart title="Publish pipeline"]
start [terminator]: Draft
review [diamond]: Approved?
publish: Publish
revise: Request changes
done [rounded]: Live
start -> review
review -> publish: yes
review -> revise: no
revise -> start
publish -> done
::

## Sequence

::diagram[type=sequence title="Login handshake"]
actor user: User
actor app: Web App
actor api: API
actor db: Database
user -> app: Enter credentials
app -> api: POST /login
activate api
api -> db: SELECT user
db --> api: row
api --> app: 200 + token
deactivate api
app --> user: Welcome
::

