## Class

::diagram[type=class title="Billing domain"]
Account: +id, -email, +plan, +suspend(), +reactivate()
Subscription: +id, +status, +renew(), -prorate()
Invoice: +id, +total, +issue()
PlanTier: enum, Free, Pro, Team
Billable: trait, +bill()
Account *-> Subscription: owns
Subscription o-> Invoice: issues
Subscription ^-> Billable
Account -> PlanTier: selects
::

