## Mermaid syntax

Bodies written in mermaid are detected by their header line and translated
to the native DSL — same deterministic SVG, no client-side JavaScript.

::diagram[type=mermaid title="Mermaid flowchart"]
flowchart LR
  A[Author writes mermaid] --> B{Header known?}
  B -->|yes| C[Translate to native DSL]
  B -->|no| D[Prose fallback]
  C --> E([Deterministic SVG])
::

## Chart aliases

`pie`, `donut`, `radar` and `xychart` bodies forward to the `::chart`
pipeline (`xychart` renders as a line chart).

